{
  "description": "RefusalPolicy for main-frame responses. Statuses below 400 -> none whatever the header. 530 -> offline. No Yaran-Refusal: 401/403 -> reauth, else none. With the header: access-not-owner -> not_owner; access-keys-unavailable -> keys_unavailable; other access-* -> reauth; host-* -> host_disconnected; anything else by status (401 reauth, 503 unavailable, else code_overlay). diagnostic is true when the code is not in the registry (cloud/protocol/registry/refusals.json). Codes compare exactly (case-sensitive).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "ok",
      "status": 200,
      "refusal": null,
      "expect": {
        "decision": "none",
        "diagnostic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "redirect",
      "status": 302,
      "refusal": null,
      "expect": {
        "decision": "none",
        "diagnostic": false
      }
    },
    {
